[{"title":"十月二十八日夜鸡初鸣时梦与数女仙遇其一作诗示予颇哀怨如人间语惟末句稍异予戏之曰若无此句不可为神仙矣其一从傍戒曰汝当勿忘此规作诗者甚有愧色予颇悔之既觉赋两绝句以解嘲 其二","author":"陆游","text":"虹作飞桥蜃吐楼，群仙来赋海山秋。\n玉姝定自多才思，更与人间替说愁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4374,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十月十七日予生日也孤村风雨萧然偶得二绝句 其一","author":"陆游","text":"少傅奉诏朝京师，舣船生我淮之湄。\n宣和七年冬十月，犹是中原无事时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4375,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十月十七日予生日也孤村风雨萧然偶得二绝句 其二","author":"陆游","text":"我生急雨暗淮天，出没蛟鼍浪入船。\n白首功名无尺寸，茅檐还听雨声眠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4376,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十月下旬暄甚戏作小诗","author":"陆游","text":"老怯霜风尽日眠，素屏纸帐拥蛮毡。\n为君小试回春手，便似暄妍二月天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4377,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十月苦蝇二首 其二","author":"陆游","text":"十月江南未拥炉，痴蝇扰扰莫嫌渠。\n细看岂是坚牢物，付与清霜为扫除。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4378,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十月苦蝇二首 其一","author":"陆游","text":"村北村南打稻忙，浮云吹尽见朝阳。\n不宜便作晴明看，扑面飞蝇未退藏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4379,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又作二首自解 其一","author":"陆游","text":"尽日溪边艇子斜，治生不种邵平瓜。\n已分邻舍红莲米，更啜僧房紫笋茶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4380,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又作二首自解 其二","author":"陆游","text":"灵府安平四体和，经时止酒颊常酡。\n老生要是常谈尔，吐纳馀闲即按摩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4381,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"万庵禅师真赞","author":"陆游","text":"洒洒落落五十年，一句不说祖师禅。\n妙喜堂中正法眼，等闲灭在瞎驴边。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4382,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"三二年来夜梦每过吾庐之西一士友家观书饮酒方梦时亦自知其为梦也二首 其二","author":"陆游","text":"清言亹亹岸纶巾，久矣吾游无若人。\n自怪梦中来往熟，抱琴携酒过西邻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4383,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"三二年来夜梦每过吾庐之西一士友家观书饮酒方梦时亦自知其为梦也二首 其一","author":"陆游","text":"西邻好友工谈笑，每见明知是梦中。\n樽酒不空书满架，何时真得与君同。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4384,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"三月三十夜闻杜宇","author":"陆游","text":"斗转春归不自由，韶华已逐水东流。\n子规独抱区区意，血泪交零晓未休。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4385,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"三峡歌九首 其五","author":"陆游","text":"险诈沾沾不愧天，交情回首薄如烟。\n东游万里虽堪乐，滟滪瞿唐要放船。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4386,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"三峡歌九首 其六","author":"陆游","text":"蛮江水碧瘴花红，白舫黄旗无便风。\n涪万四时常避水，棚居高出乱云中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4387,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"三峡歌九首 其四","author":"陆游","text":"锦绣楼前看卖花，麝香山下摘新茶。\n长安卿相多忧畏，老向夔州不用嗟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4388,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"三峡歌九首 其二","author":"陆游","text":"不怕滩如竹节稠，新滩已过可无忧。\n古妆峨峨一尺髻，木盎银杯邀客舟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4389,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"三峡歌九首 其八","author":"陆游","text":"万州溪西花柳多，四邻相应竹枝歌。\n问君今夕不痛饮，奈此满川明月何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4390,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"三峡歌九首 其一","author":"陆游","text":"神女庙前秋月明，黄牛峡里暮猿声。\n危途性命不容恤，百丈牵船侵夜行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4391,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"三峡歌九首 其三","author":"陆游","text":"十二巫山见九峰，船头彩翠满秋空。\n朝云暮雨浑虚语，一夜猿啼明月中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4392,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"三峡歌九首 其九","author":"陆游","text":"我游南宾春暮时，蜀船曾系挂猿枝。\n云迷江岸屈原塔，花落空山夏禹祠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4393,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上巳小饮追忆乾道中尝以是日病酒留三泉江月亭悽然有感","author":"陆游","text":"零落残花一两枝，绿阴庭院燕差池。\n隔墙笑语鞦韆散，惆怅三泉驿里时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4394,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上元后连数日小雨作寒戏作四首 其三","author":"陆游","text":"烟笼天阙青鸳湿，水涨官河画鹢浮。\n解赋春阴三十首，不应惟有宋鄜州。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4395,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上元后连数日小雨作寒戏作四首 其一","author":"陆游","text":"呼儿取酒敌春寒，病起驼裘剩觉宽。\n万事不妨高枕卧，始知老子耐悲欢。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4396,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上元后连数日小雨作寒戏作四首 其四","author":"陆游","text":"拟拨残书出郭行，浮云忽已败春晴。\n穷阎今雨无车马，卧听深泥溅履声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4397,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上元后连数日小雨作寒戏作四首 其二","author":"陆游","text":"春风催暖入园林，一片云生又作阴。\n留得梅花三日住，谁云造物本无心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4398,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上方铦老求宿芦诗宿芦盖所寓室名以其似渔舟也","author":"陆游","text":"一曲亭前水接天，放翁短棹弄风烟。\n宿芦纵有江湖趣，犹是人间赝钓船。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4399,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"与儿辈论李杜韩柳文章偶成","author":"陆游","text":"吏部仪曹体不同，拾遗供奉各家风。\n未言看到无同处，看得同时已有功。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4400,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"丫头岩见周洪道以进士入都日题字","author":"陆游","text":"乌巾白纻蹋京尘，瑶树琼林照路人。\n西省归来名盖代，两行墨色尚如新。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4401,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"久不得张汉州书","author":"陆游","text":"尽道三巴远，那无一纸书。\n衰迟自难记，不是故人疏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4402,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"久雨骤晴山园桃李烂漫独海棠未甚开戏作","author":"陆游","text":"雨霁风和日渐长，小园尊酒答年光。\n直令桃李能言语，何似多情睡海棠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4403,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"乡人或病予诗多道蜀中遨乐之盛适春日游镜湖共请赋山阴风物遂即杯酒间作四绝句却当持以誇西州故人也 其三","author":"陆游","text":"湖波绿似鸭头深，一日春晴直万金。\n好事谁家斗歌舞，方舟齐榜出花阴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4404,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"乡人或病予诗多道蜀中遨乐之盛适春日游镜湖共请赋山阴风物遂即杯酒间作四绝句却当持以誇西州故人也 其一","author":"陆游","text":"嫩日轻云淡沲天，扑灯过后卖花前。\n便从水阁杭湖去，捲起朱帘上画船。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4405,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"口占送岩师还大梅护圣","author":"陆游","text":"放翁白发已萧然，黄纸新除玉局仙。\n寄语山头老师叔，欲分茅舍度残年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4406,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"大风","author":"陆游","text":"初闻澒洞怒涛翻，徐听骖驔战马奔。\n纸帐蒲团坐清夜，恍如身在若耶村。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4407,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"大安病酒留半日王守复来招不往送酒解酲因小饮江月馆","author":"刘攽","text":"江驿春酲半日留，更烦送酒为扶头。\n柳花漠漠嘉陵岸，别是天涯一段愁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4408,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"大雨排闷二首 其二","author":"陆游","text":"三日断行路，束薪无处求。\n床头周易在，且复送悠悠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4409,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"大雨排闷二首 其一","author":"陆游","text":"地润础流水，气蒸人脱裘。\n前知暴雨至，孰解老农忧。","collec